    {
      "id": "en.n6.class-52.t01",
      "en": "I'd appreciate it if you could set up the tents before ten.",
      "es": "Te agradecería que pudieras montar las carpas antes de las diez.",
      "explanationEs": "I'd appreciate it if + you could + verbo base: petición cortés; could suaviza más que can.",
