    {
      "id": "en.n6.class-52.t05",
      "en": "The deadline is Friday, so I'd appreciate it if you could send the list today.",
      "es": "El plazo es el viernes, así que te agradecería que pudieras enviar la lista hoy.",
      "explanationEs": "Deadline = plazo; puedes pedir algo antes del plazo oficial.",
      "segments": [
        "The deadline is Friday, so I'd appreciate it",
        "if you could send the list today."
